22:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-KYK/GSB: international-student applications are a distinct check",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"KYK/GSB: international-student applications are a distinct check"}],[["$","p","GSB’s general information includes non-scholarship international students among categories applying in the ministry’s designated period through e-Devlet. A dedicated international-student application service is listed on the official portal.",{"children":"GSB’s general information includes non-scholarship international students among categories applying in the ministry’s designated period through e-Devlet. A dedicated international-student application service is listed on the official portal."}],["$","p","The dorm FAQ includes international-student document and broader accommodation conditions. Check those and the current category before assuming you can apply. The existence of an application service is not evidence of an open period or a guaranteed placement.",{"children":"The dorm FAQ includes international-student document and broader accommodation conditions. Check those and the current category before assuming you can apply. The existence of an application service is not evidence of an open period or a guaranteed placement."}],["$","p","If you do not yet have the required identity/login or residence evidence, ask the university how the timing should work for your case. Keep temporary accommodation available while eligibility or allocation is unresolved.",{"children":"If you do not yet have the required identity/login or residence evidence, ask the university how the timing should work for your case. Keep temporary accommodation available while eligibility or allocation is unresolved."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://kygm.gsb.gov.tr/Sayfalar/2434/2389/genel-bilgiler.aspx",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://kygm.gsb.gov.tr/Sayfalar/2434/2389/genel-bilgiler.aspx","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"GSB/KYK: general application information"}]]}],["$","span","https://kygm.gsb.gov.tr/Sayfalar/2678/2388/sikca-sorulan-sorular-yurt.aspx",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://kygm.gsb.gov.tr/Sayfalar/2678/2388/sikca-sorulan-sorular-yurt.aspx","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"GSB/KYK: accommodation eligibility FAQ"}]]}],["$","span","https://turkiye.gov.tr/genclik-ve-spor-uluslararasi-ogrenciler-icin-yurt-basvurusu",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://turkiye.gov.tr/genclik-ve-spor-uluslararasi-ogrenciler-icin-yurt-basvurusu","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Official international-student dorm application service"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-University dorms and scholarship rooms",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"University dorms and scholarship rooms"}],[["$","p","Ask whether you must submit a separate housing application even with an academic offer. A tuition waiver does not imply a room award, and a room award can specify occupancy type and academic conditions.",{"children":"Ask whether you must submit a separate housing application even with an academic offer. A tuition waiver does not imply a room award, and a room award can specify occupancy type and academic conditions."}],["$","p","Compare undergraduate and graduate room eligibility rather than borrowing a friend’s allocation. Confirm the contract’s start and end, holiday access, summer storage and whether your room is available through the entire period you plan to remain.",{"children":"Compare undergraduate and graduate room eligibility rather than borrowing a friend’s allocation. Confirm the contract’s start and end, holiday access, summer storage and whether your room is available through the entire period you plan to remain."}],"$L26"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L27","$L28"]}],"$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c"]}]
