29:["$","section","3-Read room prices in their original unit",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Read room prices in their original unit"}],[["$","p","A quote can be per person, per room or per flat; monthly, semester-based or academic-year based. Write the unit before comparing. Ask whether meals, utilities and internet are included and whether extra charges vary with use.",{"children":"A quote can be per person, per room or per flat; monthly, semester-based or academic-year based. Write the unit before comparing. Ask whether meals, utilities and internet are included and whether extra charges vary with use."}],["$","p","Sabancı’s current dorm table, for example, separates undergraduate and graduate room types and lists a TRY 34,000 deposit, with a stated exception for dorm scholarship holders. It also shows annual and semester charges. This is an institution-specific example, not a national deposit rule.",{"children":"Sabancı’s current dorm table, for example, separates undergraduate and graduate room types and lists a TRY 34,000 deposit, with a stated exception for dorm scholarship holders. It also shows annual and semester charges. This is an institution-specific example, not a national deposit rule."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://dorm.sabanciuniv.edu/tr/yurt-ucretleri",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://dorm.sabanciuniv.edu/tr/yurt-ucretleri","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Sabancı dormitory fee and deposit schedule"}]]}]]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Read room prices in their original unit","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/cost-of-living-in-turkey-for-students/",{"href":"/guides/cost-of-living-in-turkey-for-students/","children":["Living-cost ranges and worked budgets",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
2a:["$","section","4-Private dorm or shared apartment: ask different questions",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Private dorm or shared apartment: ask different questions"}],[["$","p","For a private dorm, confirm room occupancy, meal plan, curfew/guest arrangements where relevant, internet and what happens if you leave early. Visit or request verifiable current room details before signing.",{"children":"For a private dorm, confirm room occupancy, meal plan, curfew/guest arrangements where relevant, internet and what happens if you leave early. Visit or request verifiable current room details before signing."}],["$","p","For an apartment, agree who is named on the contract, how bills are divided, who holds the deposit and what happens when a flatmate leaves. Confirm furnishing and heating arrangements; a bare room and a furnished room at the same rent have different arrival costs.",{"children":"For an apartment, agree who is named on the contract, how bills are divided, who holds the deposit and what happens when a flatmate leaves. Confirm furnishing and heating arrangements; a bare room and a furnished room at the same rent have different arrival costs."}],["$","p","Original scenario: three students split a whole-flat price. One arrives a month late. They should agree before signing whether the other two cover that share temporarily, whether a replacement is allowed and whose name appears on each payment. Without that agreement, the monthly budget hides a liability.",{"children":"Original scenario: three students split a whole-flat price. One arrives a month late. They should agree before signing whether the other two cover that share temporarily, whether a replacement is allowed and whose name appears on each payment. Without that agreement, the monthly budget hides a liability."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2b:["$","section","5-Can the accommodation support your residence file?",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Can the accommodation support your residence file?"}],[["$","p","Ask the university which address evidence applies to the chosen arrangement. A booking screenshot is not automatically the required residence document. For a dorm, establish who issues the formal occupancy record; for a rental, confirm the accepted contract and authentication process.",{"children":"Ask the university which address evidence applies to the chosen arrangement. A booking screenshot is not automatically the required residence document. For a dorm, establish who issues the formal occupancy record; for a rental, confirm the accepted contract and authentication process."}],["$","p","Do this before paying a non-refundable reservation. It is easier to choose a suitable arrangement at the start than to repair an unusable address file after arrival.",{"children":"Do this before paying a non-refundable reservation. It is easier to choose a suitable arrangement at the start than to repair an unusable address file after arrival."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Can the accommodation support your residence file?","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/turkey-student-residence-permit/",{"href":"/guides/turkey-student-residence-permit/","children":["Residence permit and address evidence",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
2c:["$","section","6-Build a housing fallback without paying twice",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a housing fallback without paying twice"}],[["$","p","Keep a written list of application, result and payment dates. Where one allocation comes later than another offer, ask about refund or cancellation terms before committing. Do not assume that a future public-dorm result will reimburse a private contract.",{"children":"Keep a written list of application, result and payment dates. Where one allocation comes later than another offer, ask about refund or cancellation terms before committing. Do not assume that a future public-dorm result will reimburse a private contract."}],["$","p","Compare campus travel at the times you will actually attend classes. A shorter journey can protect study time, but the choice still needs to fit the real monthly total and available room, not only an attractive campus photograph.",{"children":"Compare campus travel at the times you will actually attend classes. A shorter journey can protect study time, but the choice still needs to fit the real monthly total and available room, not only an attractive campus photograph."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L2d",null,{"id":"guides/student-accommodation-turkey:section-7","title":"Check your progress","items":["I am eligible for the specific housing category and period.","I have a written room allocation or a realistic fallback.","I know the price unit, included services and deposit rules.","I understand cancellation, summer and flatmate-change conditions.","The accommodation can provide the address evidence requested for my case."]}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Build a housing fallback without paying twice","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/cost-of-living-in-turkey-for-students/",{"href":"/guides/cost-of-living-in-turkey-for-students/","children":["Istanbul and Ankara budget inputs",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","a","/downloads/turkey-housing-comparison.csv",{"href":"/downloads/turkey-housing-comparison.csv","download":true,"children":["Download the housing comparison checklist (CSV)",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
